# The {{vern|ocellated blenny|pedia=1]] ({{taxlink|Opisthocentrus ocellatus|species|noshow=1}}).
# The [[flying gurnard]] ({{taxlink|Dactyloptena orientalis|species|noshow=1}}).
# {{taxlink|Exocoetus volitans|species|noshow=1}}, a [[flying fish]] of the Atlantic.
# A [[chiton]], a [[mollusc]] of the class [[Polyplacophora]].
# Any of several brightly colored fishes

